[0.030369, "o", "\r\n   __            _ _   _ _\r\n  / _| __ _ _   _| | |_| (_)_ __   ___\r\n | |_ / _` | | | | | __| | | '_ \\ / _ \\    silent-failure testing\r\n |  _| (_| | |_| | | |_| | | | | |  __/        for AI agents\r\n |_|  \\__,_|\\__,_|_|\\__|_|_|_| |_|\\___|\r\n\r\n"]
[3.034703, "o", "AI agents don't usually crash. They fail SILENTLY —\r\na confident, wrong answer with a 200 OK. Evals miss it.\r\n\r\n"]
[7.236384, "o", "faultline breaks an agent's tools on purpose and catches the lie.\r\n\r\n"]
[11.4393, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n>>> Right now: faultline is driving a REAL Claude agent,\r\n>>> feeding it a wrong inventory number, watching what it does.\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n"]
[13.280535, "o", "faultline is driving a REAL Claude agent and trying its fault library...\r\n\r\n"]
[17.351602, "o", "\r\nfaultline · check report\r\n==============================================================\r\nbaseline: agent ran OK (no fault)\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n⚠  wrong-number          FAIL           [SILENT, SILENT, SILENT]  took action [_place_order] on corrupted data that it would NOT on real data\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------\r\nResilience: 0/1 faults handled\r\n⚠ 1 SILENT failure(s) — the dangerous kind:\r\n    wrong-number: took action [_place_order] on corrupted data that it would NOT on real data\r\n\r\nSuggested fixes (then re-run to verify):\r\n  - wrong-number: guard the value before any irreversible action — cross-check a 2nd independent source or range/sanity-check it, and assert an invariant (refuse to act if the value is implausible).\r\n\r\n"]
[17.352456, "o", "\r\n(real Claude API calls faultline made: 4)\r\n"]
[22.214785, "o", "\r\n============================================================\r\nNow point it at the 8 most popular agent frameworks, live:\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\n"]
[24.619896, "o", "  custom order agent     CAUGHT a silent failure\r\n  LangGraph              CAUGHT a silent failure\r\n  pydantic-ai            CAUGHT a silent failure\r\n  agno                   CAUGHT a silent failure\r\n  LlamaIndex RAG         CAUGHT a silent failure\r\n  ag2 / AutoGen          CAUGHT a silent failure\r\n  CrewAI                 CAUGHT a silent failure\r\n  smolagents             pass (agent was resilient)\r\n\r\n"]
[29.425023, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  7 / 8 frameworks — the TOOL caught a silent failure, live.\r\n  No LLM-judge. Deterministic. ~10 cents. Runs in your CI.\r\n  one command:  python3 bench/tool_caught/run_all_live.py\r\n------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
